# Separation of powers (ported from RoseLohr/roses-food-blog CODEOWNERS; same
# role): the gate, the review panel, and the frozen-methodology governance
# surfaces must NOT be modifiable by the same identity that writes the code
# they gate, without a separate explicit approval by the responsible role. In
# this solo setup without a separate policy repo, this is the structural
# substitute: changes to any protected path below require the owner's own
# distinct sign-off.
#
# NOTE: CODEOWNERS only ENFORCES once branch protection enables
# "Require review from Code Owners" — a repo-settings action for the
# human-in-command (same open item as required status checks).

# The deterministic gate and the review panel itself
/.github/               @mglaeser
/scripts/               @mglaeser

# The frozen-methodology governance surfaces (F-01/L-07)
/frozen_methodology.json            @mglaeser
/app/methodology.py                 @mglaeser
/tests/test_frozen_methodology.py   @mglaeser
/docs/GOVERNANCE_FREEZE_RULE.md     @mglaeser
/docs/PINS_DECISION_MEMO.md         @mglaeser
/docs/PIN_EVIDENCE_PACK.md          @mglaeser
/docs/PIN_EVIDENCE_PACK_2.md        @mglaeser
